flowchart LR
    S["SKU\ncategory · base_price · cost"]
    C["PromotionCase\nscenario · agent + human decision\noutcome · oracle · regret"]
    L["Lesson\nscope · conditions · recommendation\nevidence · confidence · profit advantage"]

    S -->|case_sku| C
    C -->|lesson_evidence| L
    L -.->|lesson_sku_scope\noptional| S

    H["Category Manager"] -->|accept / change + reason| C
